ith 433 | 954 | 61.9%). The image and page-15 text show one Listings column ('266 625') and one Share column. Read literally, the markdown gives wrong counts (e.g. 266, 93). The page text carries the intact figures.\",\"source_objects\":[{\"id\":\"S1\",\"type\":\"table\",\"label\":\"table_8.md\",\"path\":\"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/tables/table_8.md\",\"page\":15,\"page_label\":\"15\",\"section\":null,\"text_quote\":\"No mention of cycling\",\"url\":null,\"object_id\":\"OBJ-8cd1361a5f77a70c5008ee4d\",\"correspondence\":\"text\",\"verification_note\":\"Compared with retained table_8.png; counts split across value_1/value_2 in the markdown.\"},{\"id\":\"S2\",\"type\":\"text\",\"label\":\"page 15 text\",\"path\":\"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/pages/page_015.md\",\"page\":15,\"page_label\":\"15\",\"section\":null,\"text_quote\":\"Any mention of cycling 266 625 38.1%\",\"url\":null,\"object_id\":\"OBJ-6402cd90a906f1f82672a86f\",\"correspondence\":\"text\",\"verification_note\":\"Safe fallback.\"}],\"claim_evidence_links\":[{\"claim_text\":\"Counts in one column\",\"source_object_ids\":[\"S1\",\"S2\"],\"relation\":\"contradicts\",\"note\":\"Thousands separator treated as a column break.\"}],\"numeric_check\":null,\"suggested_fix\":\"Use pages/page_015.md or table_8.png for Table 8 counts. Do not read table_8.csv/.md as 266 and 625.\"},{\"id\":\"PARSER-009\",\"category\":\"table_extraction\",\"finding_summary\":\"Table 9 is extracted as a single unstructured column. Type/word-part pairs are separated, the first row's 'The word “bicycle”' and '“sykkel” on its own' sit on different lines, and the crop and markdown include the Appendix B heading and paragraph.\",\"issue_type\":\"parser_artifact\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"location\":{\"page\":18,\"page_label\":\"18\",\"section\":\"Appendix A.3.2 / Table 9\",\"text_quote\":\"“sykkel” on its own\",\"precision\":\"exact\"},\"claim_text\":\"The structured extraction of Table 9 pa