 main defects are in the structured table objects. All nine tables come from the caption_text_fallback route, and none is a clean structured table. Tables 1, 2, 5, 6, 7, 8 and 9 are flattened, truncated, mis-columned or text-contaminated in their CSV/markdown. Tables 3 and 4 have a merged header row. The Figure 1 crop omits the bar chart, the Figure 4 crop cuts the second sentence of its caption, and Figure 3's page-text axis labels are scrambled. The page text, the page images and the table/figure PNG crops give safe fallbacks for all of these, so substantive review can proceed. The structured table CSV/markdown should not be used as primary evidence.","findings":[{"id":"PARSER-001","category":"table_extraction","finding_summary":"Table 1's structured markdown collapses a four-column table (Field group, Example from the pilot, Main use, Pilot) into two columns, and the last row's 'Partly' value is absorbed into the row label instead of the Pilot column.","issue_type":"parser_artifact","severity":"medium","confidence":"high","location":{"page":5,"page_label":"5","section":"3.1.3 / Table 1","text_quote":"Location description “From the top of the bridge down to Bruvegen” Matching to Partly","precision":"exact"},"claim_text":"The structured extraction of Table 1 preserves its four columns and cell assignments.","assessment":"no","cannot_verify_reason":null,"evidence_summary":"The inventory marks Table 1 caption_text_contaminated (flags ragged_rows, possible_prose_contamination; col_count 2; header not promoted). In table_1.md the header and body cells sit in one row_label cell and only Yes/No appear in value_1. The final row has no value_1 entry because 'Partly' is inside the label. The retained table_1.png and page 5 image show four distinct columns with 'Partly' in the Pilot column. The page-5 text keeps the row order.","source_objects":[{"id":"S1","type":"table","label":"table_1.md","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/tables/table_1.md","page":5,"page_label":"5","section":null,"text_quote":"Location description “From the top of the bridge down to Bruvegen” Matching to Partly","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-8ec9459ce44d02c62d0a27bf","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"Compared with retained table_1.png: four columns visible, Partly in the Pilot column."},{"id":"S2","type":"figure","label":"page 5 image","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/page_images/page_005.png","page":5,"page_label":"5","section":null,"text_quote":null,"url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-c95aac7deda93a66f4e54a92","correspondence":"visual","verification_note":"Table 1 region compared; the page text in pages/page_005.md is the safer fallback."}],"claim_evidence_links":[{"claim_text":"Table 1 columns preserved","source_object_ids":["S1","S2"],"relation":"contradicts","note":"Four columns in image vs two in markdown."}],"numeric_check":null,"suggested_fix":"Use pages/page_005.md or table_1.png for Table 1. Do not rely on table_1.csv/.md for column assignment."},{"id":"PARSER-002","category":"table_extraction","finding_summary":"Table 2's structured CSV/markdown is truncated and misaligned. It stops partway through the Tromsø row, omits the Grettefoss Bridge row and the Opening date/Status cells for Tromsø, and splits '5 Oct 2026' across columns.","issue_type":"parser_artifact","severity":"medium","confidence":"high","location":{"page":5,"page_label":"5","section":"3.1.4 / Table 2","text_quote":"Tromsø Bridge, cycle track","precision":"exact"},"claim_text":"The structured extraction of Table 2 contains all four project rows with their five columns.","assessment":"no","cannot_verify_reason":null,"evidence_summary":"table_2.md lists the headers as separate rows, puts '5 Oct' and '2026' in different columns, and ends after the Tromsø row's article count. The image shows four rows (Homborsund, Gusthaugen–Leinskorsen, Tromsø Bridge, Grettefoss Bridge) with footnotes a, b and c. The retained crop also includes the following prose ('The pilot showed...'). The page-5 text retains all rows and footnotes.","source_objects":[{"id":"S1","type":"table","label":"table_2.md","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/tables/table_2.md","page":5,"page_label":"5","section":null,"text_quote":"Tromsø Bridge, cycle track","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-dbc6f4a9a830bbbd128e371e","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"Compared with retained table_2.png (four data rows visible)."},{"id":"S2","type":"text","label":"page 5 text","path":"work/bicycle-infrastructure-paper/parsed/pages/page_005.md","page":5,"page_label":"5","section":null,"text_quote":"Grettefoss Bridge Flesberg 1 3 Nov 2026c Planned","url":null,"object_id":"OBJ-9d16c139938370d7a97e77c6","correspondence":"text","verification_note":"Safe fallback containing the omitted row."}],"claim_evidence_links":[{"claim_text":"Table 2 has all four rows","source_object_ids":["S1","S2"],"relation":"contradicts","note":"Grettefoss row and Tromsø date/status are missing from the structured file."}],"numeric_check":null,"suggested_fix":"Use pages/page_005.md or table_2.png for Table 2. Do not use table_2.csv/.md."},{"id":"PARSER-003","category":"table_extraction","finding_summary":"Table 3's markdown merges the header row 'Pilot coder / Relevant / Not relevant / Total' into one label cell, and 'Second coder' sits in its own row without column alignment.","issue_type":"parser_artifact","severity":"low","confidence":"high","location":{"page":7,"page_label":"7","section":"Table 3","text_quote":"Pilot coder Relevant Not relevant Total","precision":"exact"},"claim_text":"The structured extraction of Table 3 preserves the header-to-column alignment of the 2x2 agreement table.","assessment":"partially","cannot_verify_reason":null,"evidence_summary":"The body cells (3, 0, 3; 1, 30, 31; 4, 30, 34) and the line 'Overall agreement 97% (33 of 34 articles)' match the image row by row. Only the header is merged and unpromoted. Status: caption_text_needs_visual_verification.","source_